ature-behaviour\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Behaviour\">Behaviour</span></h3>\n<p>\tChases her target. She will transform into <a href=\"#/wiki/Feroxa%20%28Killable%20Werewolf%29\">her killable werewolf form</a> when she is at about half health. Feroxa never retreats.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-strategy\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Strategy\">Strategy</span></h3>\n<p>\tShe cannot be damaged by any attacks. You must guide her over the <a href=\"#/wiki/Silvered%20Trap\">Silvered Traps</a>. Drag <a href=\"#/wiki/Closed%20Silvered%20Trap\">Closed Silvered Traps</a> to the ground and use them to open them, at which point the silvered trap will become immobile and that have been placed on the floor laid by players. When she walks over these traps she will be damaged for 1000 health.\n</p><p>When she walks over 20 traps, she will transform into <a href=\"#/wiki/Feroxa%20%28Killable%20Werewolf%29\">her killable werewolf form</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Loot\">Loot</span></h3>\n<p><i>There is no loot data for this creature. Please consider subtmitting loot logs for this creature using the Loot Statistics parser.</i>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Creatures\">Related Creatures</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body\">\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Lycanthropes\">Lycanthropes</span></h4>\n<div class=\"navigation-list-wrapper\"><ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Ayana%20the%20Crimson%20Curse\">Ayana the Crimson Curse</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Black%20Vixen\">Black Vixen</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Bloodback\">Bloodback</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Cunning%20Werepanther\">Cunning Werepanther</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Darkfang\">Darkfang</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Doomhowl\">Doomhowl</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Feral%20Werecrocodile\">Feral Werecrocodile</a></li><li